<div class="p-4">
    <ul class="nav nav-tabs mb-3" role="tablist">
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link active" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabWlList"><i class="bi bi-list-ul me-1"></i>白名单列表</button></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabWlUpload"><i class="bi bi-upload me-1"></i>上传 sys 选择添加</button></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabWlHash"><i class="bi bi-hash me-1"></i>按哈希添加</button></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabWlCert"><i class="bi bi-award me-1"></i>按证书添加</button></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="tab-content">
        <!-- ── 白名单列表 ── -->
        <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="tabWlList">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-list-ul me-2"></i>白名单条目
                        <span class="badge badge-pass ms-2" id="wlStatTotal">-</span>
                        <span class="text-muted small ms-2">(哈希:<span id="wlStatHash">-</span> / 证书:<span id="wlStatCert">-</span>)</span>
                    </span>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="wlTypeFilter" style="width:130px" onchange="loadWlList()">
                            <option value="">全部类型</option>
                            <option value="hash">哈希</option>
                            <option value="cert">证书</option>
                        </select>
                        <div class="input-group input-group-sm" style="width:260px">
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="wlSearch" placeholder="搜索名称 / 哈希 / Subject..." onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')loadWlList()">
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" onclick="loadWlList()"><i class="bi bi-search"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm" onclick="loadWlList()"><i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body p-0">
                    <div class="table-responsive" style="max-height:65vh;overflow:auto">
                        <table class="table table-hover table-sm mb-0">
                            <thead class="sticky-top bg-white">
                                <tr><th>类型</th><th>名称</th><th>SHA256 / 指纹</th><th>Subject</th><th>添加时间</th><th>备注</th><th>操作</th></tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="wlTableBody"><tr><td colspan="7" class="text-center text-muted py-4">加载中...</td></tr></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span class="text-muted small" id="wlPageInfo">-</span>
                    <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm">
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="wlPrev" onclick="wlChangePage(-1)"><i class="bi bi-chevron-left"></i></button>
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="wlNext" onclick="wlChangePage(1)"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ── 上传 sys 选择添加 ── -->
        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tabWlUpload">
            <div class="card" style="max-width:860px">
                <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-upload me-2"></i>上传 .sys 文件,选择添加哈希还是添加某个证书</div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        上传驱动文件后,后端会计算 MD5/SHA1/SHA256 并提取所有签名者证书(包括嵌套在 UnauthAttrs 里的厂商签名)。
                        你可以在结果中选择「添加哈希」或「添加其中某个证书」。
                    </p>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">驱动文件 (.sys)</label>
                        <input type="file" class="form-control" id="wlUploadFile" accept=".sys,.dll,.exe">
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="wlUploadBtn" onclick="uploadSysForParse()">
                        <i class="bi bi-search me-1"></i>解析文件
                    </button>
                    <div id="wlUploadResult" class="mt-3"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ── 按哈希添加 ── -->
        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tabWlHash">
            <div class="card" style="max-width:640px">
                <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-hash me-2"></i>手动输入哈希添加白名单</div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p class="text-muted small">直接填写驱动名与至少一个哈希(MD5 32位 / SHA1 40位 / SHA256 64位,十六进制)。</p>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">驱动名</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="wlHashName" placeholder="如:klif.sys">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">MD5 (32位)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="wlHashMd5" placeholder="可选">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">SHA1 (40位)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="wlHashSha1" placeholder="可选">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">SHA256 (64位)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="wlHashSha256" placeholder="可选">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">备注 (可选)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="wlHashNotes" placeholder="如:卡巴斯基驱动,排除">
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn btn-success btn-sm" id="wlHashBtn" onclick="addByHash()">
                        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-1"></i>添加白名单
                    </button>
                    <div id="wlHashResult" class="mt-3"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ── 按证书添加 ── -->
        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tabWlCert">
            <div class="card" style="max-width:640px">
                <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-award me-2"></i>手动按证书 Subject 添加白名单</div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        填写签名者证书的 Subject(完整或前缀匹配)。例如填 <code>CN="Kaspersky"</code> 即可匹配所有 Kaspersky 签发的驱动。
                        也可以同时填 SHA256 指纹做精确匹配。
                    </p>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">证书 Subject (完整或前缀)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="wlCertSubject" placeholder='如:CN="AO Kaspersky Lab"'>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">证书 SHA256 指纹 (可选,精确匹配)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="wlCertThumbprint" placeholder="64 位十六进制,可选">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">证书颁发者 Issuer (可选)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="wlCertIssuer" placeholder="可选">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">显示名 (可选)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="wlCertDisplay" placeholder="如:卡巴斯基">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">备注 (可选)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="wlCertNotes" placeholder="如:杀毒软件,排除">
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn btn-success btn-sm" id="wlCertBtn" onclick="addByCert()">
                        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-1"></i>添加白名单
                    </button>
                    <div id="wlCertResult" class="mt-3"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script src="/js/whitelist-dashboard.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
